tes also offer different deductions and credits. So relocating doesn't touch your federal return, but it can dramatically change what ends up in your bank account.\"}]]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\"}]\n39:[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"salary\",{\"href\":\"/salary\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\"}]}],\"Salary After Tax\"]}]\n1a:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n3b:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n18:null\n1c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Free Relocation Tax Calculator 2026 — Compare Take-Home Pay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Free relocation calculator 2026. Compare take-home pay in IL, TX, FL, CA, NY. No sign-up. Find equivalent salary by state.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"free relocation calculator,relocation calculator,salary comparison by state,cost of living calculator,move calculator,salary equivalent calculator,state tax comparison,relocation salary calculator,moving salary calculator,free tax calculator for 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$